OL,3,GNEWSADerelict 18th Century building
OL,4,Afire suspected arson
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have launched an arson
OL,7,Finvestigation into a fire at an
OL,8,Funoccupied 18th Century building.
OL,10,FThames Valley Police said it had
OL,11,Fstarted an investigation into the cause
OL,12,Fof the blaze after fire crews were
OL,13,Fcalled at about 03:30 BST on Thursday
OL,14,Fto The Bury in Church Street, Chesham.
OL,16,FAbout 70% of one three-storey Grade
OL,17,FII-listed commercial building was
OL,18,Fdamaged, with all floors and parts of
OL,19,Fthe structure affected, Buckinghamshire
OL,20,FFire Service said.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
